<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank end-Feb reserves dip to $11.715 bln.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank end-Feb reserves dip to $11.715 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves of the Czech National Bank (CNB) stood at $11.715 billion as of the end of February, down from $11.997 billion at the end of the previous month, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
</text>
